# reduced-switch (plan section 6, M10): motion-switch under reduced motion (prefers-reduced-motion:
# reduce; macOS's Reduce motion natively): no first paint, and no switch: sin x is drawn whole at
# once, its marks with it. The same frames as motion-switch.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 392 181
shot switch-0000
wait 160
shot switch-0160
wait 140
shot switch-0300
wait 150
shot switch-0450
wait 150
shot switch-0600
wait 300
shot switch-0900
wait 300
shot switch-rest
